WEBVTT

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:14.250
Lilan.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:20.010
The Queen passed away.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:33.590
Seimiya's Tears

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:39.320
Your Highness, the Queen.

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:46.450
You don't have to, Nami.  Call me Seimiya like you always have when we're alone.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.910
Yes.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.790
How could this be...

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:59.170
Queen Harumiya passed away...

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:03.740
Father!  Please don't cause your heart to falter.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:09.570
Other Touda handlers are trying to frame us for killing the Queen.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:14.300
Now is the time to calmly think about this country's future.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:21.980
For many years, we of the Grand Duke's army have kept the neighboring forces at bay,

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:25.090
protecting the Queen and the citizens of the Queen's quarter.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:33.490
However we're shunned by the Queen's citizens, who detest war,

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:38.960
and those who have fought in fearsome wars can no longer look up to nor hear the Queen's voice.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:47.070
If we were accused of murdering the Queen on top of this, there wouldn't be any place left for us to live.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:54.560
In order for the citizens of the Grand Duke's quarter to avoid that consequence and continue on...

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:11.190
Father, it's no more than child's play to win a war against the people of the Queen's quarter.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:17.580
However, crushing them by force will not lead them to open up to us.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:28.300
There is a way to calm the quarters without having to kill the Queen.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.820
Will you leave this to me?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.180
Very well.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.730
Grandmother...

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.560
Seimiya.

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:27.680
Oh, Uncle!

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.480
Cry your heart out.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:44.950
You may be the Queen to the citizens, but you're still the cute Seimiya to me, no matter what.

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.410
Uncle?

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:06.380
You must be sad that Grandmother passed away, too.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:13.910
Yes.  But it hurts me much more... to see you crying.

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:24.420
I should give birth to the next Queen quickly, too.

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.490
You don't have to rush like that.

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:32.610
You're not just a tool to be used for creating the next Queen.

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:35.080
But Uncle...

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:40.410
There are certain things one can only see from the perspective of sitting upon the throne.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:46.730
You're the only woman in this world who can choose any man in this world to marry.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.570
Who is the man that you love?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:56.270
I... don't have such a person.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:03.110
Then who loves you the most?

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:26.520
<i>Ial.  I've seen what this country has and what it should do.</i>

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:31.960
<i>The citizens of the Queen's quarter have money and power,</i>

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:35.680
<i>and look down upon the Grand Duke's citizens as filthy people who fight in wars.</i>

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:42.270
<i>However, without them, this country would fall to neighboring countries' forces.</i>

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:49.760
<i>This country cannot be held together solely by the influence of the Queen.</i>

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.130
And now, even the Queen has...

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.710
It's the end for this country.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:14.300
If the Grand Duke marches in here with his army of Touda...

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.610
just over a dozen Sezans wouldn't stand a chance against them.

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:26.330
Still, we have to continue to live on as the Queen's shield.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:26.900
Right?

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:29.820
That's right.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.170
That's a Sezan's duty.

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:36.120
Are you sure?

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:44.990
It wasn't part of our duty to think about this country's future, was it, Captain?

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.370
We have an issue!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.260
What is it?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:02.980
Shunan-sama has arrived without notice and is requesting to see the Queen!

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:17.600
Seimiya, be sure you talk to him in a dignified manner.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:23.390
You know who killed Harumiya-sama, right?

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.330
Thank you very much for permitting me audience.

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:44.110
I offer my deepest condolences over Harumiya-sama's tragedy.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.250
"Offer condolences?"  You?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.670
Why?!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:52.780
I'm surprised how you can say such fake words.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:56.450
That shameless side of you must come from your father.

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:03.720
With all due respect, do you know who was behind the assault on Harumiya-sama?

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.160
How could you ask such a question?!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.590
Grandmother was assaulted by Touda!

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:12.710
Who other than the Grand Duke uses such a vulgar creature?

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:23.620
As you are aware, need for Touda has risen ever since the cavalry of the eastern country, Larza, began penetrating the border.

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:29.490
There are many who handle Touda within the Queen's quarter, too.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:30.770
And your point being?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:34.110
Are you telling me that our own citizens plotted this assassination?

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:42.470
Your Highness, what merit would there be in killing the Queen in such an underhanded manner?

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:45.300
If the Queen dies, you will be able to become the King.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.430
If that is no merit, then what is?

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:52.260
So you've lost faith in us that much.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:56.440
Then assassination holds even lesser meaning.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:00.470
If we were to find that this country couldn't be left in the hands of the Queen,

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.240
we would claim the throne in a glorious manner.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:09.990
We have hundreds of Touda and thousands of cavalrymen.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:24.790
Queen Seimiya, wasn't that a clear statement?

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:27.720
That's the true color of the Grand Duke.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:30.860
He thinks the throne can be acquired through force.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:37.620
Shunan, using the Touda would make it easy to take the throne from us.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:41.570
But the Queen who sits in front of you is God.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:44.680
This country shall perish the moment you kill God.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:49.950
I can't believe Queen Seimiya to be a god.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:56.900
How could an individual who can't make her country peaceful be a god?

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:00.740
What makes you say I can't bring this country to peace?

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.590
Then I ask!

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:06.840
How do you plan on curing the plague that's leading this country to its death?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:12.770
Your great <i>greed</i> is the plague of this country.

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:16.690
I will govern this country with a pure heart.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:21.920
It's true, I may not be protected by military power.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:22.790
But-

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:27.410
Who do you think protected you to this day?!

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:29.630
I'm-

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.350
I'm not talking about you personally.

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.360
I'm referring to this country.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:40.200
Do you have the courage to see it with your own eyes?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:43.820
Do you have the courage to see what the people who have been protecting this country look like?

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:49.180
No matter when and in what situation I may be, I shall never fear.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.260
Come in.

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:22.360
You Holons, who have forgotten what war is, hear us.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:35.270
We've been sent to the battlefield upon the Touda.

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:48.180
Honor and pride are our friends in war.

00:13:48.180 --> 00:14:01.110
We bear wounds as we fight, and eventually fall into the depths of Hikara.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:07.760
Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:14.260
We fight under the banner of the Grand Duke.

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:20.670
Wajyaku.  Wajyaku.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:30.550
Some day, hear the words of our cries.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:31.850
Get out!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.570
All of you men!  Shunan, you too!

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:37.420
It's only natural that you fight for the Queen!

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:39.660
That's what you soldiers do!

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:03.600
<i>I do not believe that an individual who does not know of the realities of this world should be Queen.</i>

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:10.450
<i>I will protect you forever, Seimiya-sama.</i>

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:34.060
Why not let your horse rest for the night?

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:35.620
We'll prepare some lodging, also.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.780
Thank you.

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:40.330
Instead though, I'd rather see the courtyard.

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:48.800
The salo flowers are blossoming beautifully now, right?

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:21.540
Shunan.

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:37.360
What are you doing here?

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:44.190
I thought I'd be able to talk to you if it's here, where your favorite flower, the salo, blooms.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:51.030
I, too, have something I wish to say to you.

00:16:55.590 --> 00:17:00.940
As you say, I may not know the realities of this world.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:06.060
But I will govern this country like my grandmother did.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:10.090
So that this country will always remain beautiful.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:15.990
I understand your point very well.

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.180
But at this rate, this country will...

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:20.950
We'll perish.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:32.440
To prevent that from happening, we must unite.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.550
Please let me have you.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.910
What are you implying?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:45.140
I am proposing to you.

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:58.310
That's the only way to save you and this country.

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:02.600
That's...  That's impossible!

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:02.840
I'm-

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.660
A descendant of the gods.
I'm-

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:04.260
A descendant of the gods.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.920
Is that why?

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:09.360
Is that why you can't marry a filthy son of the Grand Duke?

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:23.350
If you really believe yourself a god, and if our governing the country will lead to its end, then please show that to be the truth.

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:24.140
"Show it?"

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:31.440
Four months from today, we will be waiting for you at Tahai Aze, the origin of this country.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:36.480
We'll be there with an army of Touda to represent our quarter.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:50.450
If a miracle occurs as the legend says, where a beast-lord bows down to you, descending to save you,

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:57.390
then both father and I will have the soldiers retreat and pledge eternal loyalty to you as your subjects.

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:02.970
However, should such a miracle not occur,

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:07.100
please admit yourself to be human and become one with me.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:18.260
Are you telling me I must chose either a path of war against you or a marriage with you?

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:24.180
If you decide to marry, please raise a blue flag.

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:28.070
If you do so, I will stop the Touda from marching.

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:44.090
So you're saying you'll marry me for just the sake of this country?

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:47.540
Not because you love me?

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:52.330
You're proposing just so the Queen and the Grand Duke become a single entity?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.860
No!  I've always-

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:55.520
You lie!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.390
Seimiya-sama.

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:42.110
Are you worried that you'd be defiled if you become one with me?

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:46.200
Seimiya-sama-

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.320
I'm...
Seimiya-sama-

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.160
Uncle!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.330
Look at you, drenched in the rain.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:10.630
The Queen must be considerate of her own health, too.

00:24:01.590 --> 00:24:09.790
Beastinarians tie the beast-lords down using fear of the mute whistle, and a beast-lord never forgets that.

00:24:09.790 --> 00:24:14.710
The beast-lord handlers from Lazal who come to take Lilan away are instead shredded to pieces by her fangs.

00:24:14.710 --> 00:24:21.300
Erin stops Lilan, sacrificing the bond she has with her and forcing her to bear a scar she can never be rid of.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.010
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Beastinarian.

00:24:25.010 --> 00:26:00.030
Beastinarian
